# Private deploy-time values for projects/home/kubernetes/mcp-gateway/deploy.sh.
# Copy to secrets/home/mcp-gateway.env (git-ignored) and fill real values.
#
# LAN range and K3s node address. The gateway's NetworkPolicy admits Hermes
# (hostNetwork, so its packets arrive with the node address) and kubelet probes
# explicitly; Traefik or any other host-network pod on the node is covered by
# the same rules. Pod CIDR (10.42.0.0/16) and service CIDR (10.43.0.0/16) are
# part of the tracked manifest and do not need values here.
LAN_CIDR=192.0.2.0/24
NODE_LAN_IP=192.0.2.27
